{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19103430","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19103430","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910343001:1":{"text":"...뭐?","source_cn":"……什么？","status":"matched_gender<key:male>","hash_xxh64":"0xB1D04D42EEE60776","variant_status":"adjacent_same_source_target_same","male":"...뭐?","female":"...뭐?","variant_male_record_index":"244942","variant_female_record_index":"244943","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910343002:1":{"text":"为什么？你们不是不想回到陆地上吗？你们不是说过，想要成...","source_cn":"为什么？你们不是不想回到陆地上吗？你们不是说过，想要成...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910343003:1":{"text":"这次的洄游季，从开头就灾祸不断。提前下潜、母瑚破碎、养...","source_cn":"这次的洄游季，从开头就灾祸不断。提前下潜、母瑚破碎、养...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910343004:1":{"text":"没有你，繁育池就会缺少很多、很多能量……","source_cn":"没有你，繁育池就会缺少很多、很多能量……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x0D8FFD89954155EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910343005:1":{"text":"我们会失去很多、很多家人——包括你！","source_cn":"我们会失去很多、很多家人——包括你！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xE86AA508D8B349D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910343006:1":{"text":"——你们疯了！","source_cn":"——你们疯了！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x50EB13F9F0D1E478","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1910343007:1":{"text":"咱是不想回卡什澜，也喜欢塔拉萨，但也没说想被你们溶成水...","source_cn":"咱是不想回卡什澜，也喜欢塔拉萨，但也没说想被你们溶成水...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1910343008:1":{"text":"不、不！既然你们喜欢这里，就留下来吧！","source_cn":"不、不！既然你们喜欢这里，就留下来吧！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x670FAF80B3C9CB7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1910343009:1":{"text":"塔拉萨的生活这么美好，大海比其他地方美那么多，成为我们...","source_cn":"塔拉萨的生活这么美好，大海比其他地方美那么多，成为我们...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1910343010:1":{"text":"你们别走，再想想，再想想啊！","source_cn":"你们别走，再想想，再想想啊！","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x12DA43C10B7A1C26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1910343011:1":{"text":"……大个子，这些家伙疯了，他们已经听不进去话了！","source_cn":"……大个子，这些家伙疯了，他们已